@startuml
' Figure 33.6  The confused deputy
' Reading order: top to bottom. The customer asks the agent to refund a
' ticket on another booking; the agent holds the authority but the
' session binding checks the object against the session and refuses,
' recording both identities. From threats.controls.bound (X03).
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Customer" as C <<org>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Binding" as B <<policy>>
C -> A : Refund other booking
A -> B : refund_ticket
B -> B : Not this session
B -> B : Trail both IDs
B -[$FAIL]> A : Refused
A --> C : This booking only
@enduml
